  "{device} couldn't open that link. It may have expired, or that device may have no connection of its own.": "{device} non puido abrir esa ligazón. Pode que caducase, ou que ese dispositivo non teña conexión propia.",
  "{device} couldn't reach this device — a firewall here is blocking port {port}.": "{device} non puido contactar con este dispositivo — unha devasa de aquí bloquea o porto {port}.",
